<text><![CDATA[<div><ol id="imr5" style="list-style-position: inside;"><li>Check that the printer is powered on and shows no error lights.</li><li>Turn the printer off, wait 30 seconds, and turn it back on.</li><li>On your computer, remove the printer and add it again.</li><li>Make sure your computer is on the residence hall network, not guest Wi-Fi.</li><li>Still offline? Submit an incident and select the printer as the affected item.</li></ol></div>]]></text>
