<text><![CDATA[<div><ol class="ece-inline-style" style="list-style-position: inside;; list-style-position: inside;"><li>Find your console&#39;s MAC address in its network settings.</li><li>In the portal, submit a Guest Device Wi-Fi Access request with your device type, MAC address, and room number.</li><li>Wait for the confirmation email (usually within 1 business day).</li><li>Connect your console to the residence hall device network.</li><li>Still not working? Contact the Whitetop Hall front desk.</li></ol></div>]]></text>
